# Build inputs, not deliverables. These live outside public/ on purpose —
# anything in public/ is copied verbatim into dist/, and shipping the JPEG
# sources alongside the WebP outputs put 5.5 MB of dead weight in the deploy.
#
# `npm run fetch:images` repopulates image-source/;
# `npm run optimize:images` produces the public/images/*.webp files, which ARE
# committed. The hero video master is handled the same way.
image-source/

logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.vercel
.env*
